  "about": {
    "tagline": "EML / Est. 2026 / San Francisco",
    "title": "A textile research unit where Filipino weaving heritage meets the materials of the future.",
    "body": "EMORDES LABORATORY studies cloth at both ends of time from the optical wave of Binakol to algae knits and crystal grown fabric.\n\nEvery specimen is catalogued, swatched and available for designers, students and brands developing their next collection. Request samples, book a lab session, or commission a custom weave study."
